<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Station Casinos lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Station Casinos lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said it downgraded Station Casinos Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- stock was off 1/16 to 7-1/8.</p>
</text>
